+### D — bad input
+
+```sh
+go --check --layers 20,77   # rc=2
+go --check --layers ''      # rc=2
+```
+
+```text
+usage: …/scripts/project-node.sh --check|--apply [--project P] [--harness H] [--repo URL] [--ref R] [--role worker|builder|full] [--disk-floor GIB] [--layers 00,10,20,30,40]
+lines with [00]: 0
